#: libs/librepcb/core/serialization/fileformatmigrationv01.cpp:548
msgctxt "librepcb::FileFormatMigrationV01"
msgid "All non-plated holes (NPTH) now have automatic solder resist openings added on both board sides. The expansion value is configured in the board design rules but can be overridden in the hole properties dialog."
msgstr ""

#: libs/librepcb/core/serialization/fileformatmigrationv01.cpp:557
msgctxt "librepcb::FileFormatMigrationV01"
msgid "Non-circular via shapes are no longer supported, all vias were changed to circular now."
msgstr ""

#: libs/librepcb/core/serialization/fileformatmigrationv01.cpp:564
msgctxt "librepcb::FileFormatMigrationV01"
msgid "Plane area calculations have been adjusted, manual review and running the DRC is recommended."
msgstr ""

#: libs/librepcb/core/serialization/fileformatmigrationv01.cpp:571
msgctxt "librepcb::FileFormatMigrationV01"
msgid "Vias within planes with connect style 'None' are now fully connected to the planes since the connect style is no longer respected for vias. You might want to remove traces now which are no longer needed to connect these vias."
msgstr ""

#: libs/librepcb/core/serialization/fileformatmigrationv01.cpp:581
msgctxt "librepcb::FileFormatMigrationV01"
msgid "Board cutouts now have a dedicated layer, thus nested board outline polygons and circles have automatically been moved to the cutouts layer. As the auto-detection is not perfect, please check if each cutout has been converted correctly. The easiest way is to review the PCB in the 3D viewer."
msgstr ""

#: libs/librepcb/core/serialization/fileformatmigrationv1.cpp:306
msgctxt "librepcb::FileFormatMigrationV1"
msgid "The dedicated Gerber/Excellon generator dialog has been removed in favor of the more powerful output jobs, and the corresponding output settings will be removed from boards in an upcoming release. It is recommended to add a Gerber/Excellon output job now, as this allows to migrate the old export settings (choose \"Import Old Settings\")."
msgstr ""

#: libs/librepcb/core/serialization/fileformatmigrationv1.cpp:390
msgctxt "librepcb::FileFormatMigrationV1"
msgid "The project has set custom attributes for the BOM export ({0}). But in LibrePCB 2.0, the manual BOM export has been removed in favor of the more powerful output jobs feature. Please use output jobs now to generate the BOM. When you add a new BOM output job, those custom attributes will automatically be imported."
msgstr ""

